      {
        "type": "boolean|number"
      }
    ],
    "param": {
      "type": "InputHook",
      "optional": true
    },
    "comment": "This callback fires every time the game polls for a ButtonAction input, often several times per frame even for the same action. Since it has to do with polling, it fires regardless of whether or not the player is actually pressing any particular input. Return nil if you do not want to overwrite the input. If you do want to overwrite the input, then you have to return a boolean for the IS_ACTION_PRESSED (0) and IS_ACTION_TRIGGERED (1) input hooks, or a float between 0.0 and 1.0 for the GET_ACTION_VALUE (2) input hook."
  },
